{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs2iWWqxKT4DYcJ4EgdJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The invoice total now matches the sum of the PDF line items. The full suite passes: 4 tests, including the new regression test, which failed before the fix.\n\n**Root cause:** `invoice_total` in `billing/totals.py` computed the net as the undiscounted gross minus the unrounded discount, and rounded only the final figure. `line_totals`, which the PDF renders, rounds each discounted line to cents. When per-line rounding goes up, the charged total comes out a cent low. For example, two 0.05 lines at 50% off print as 0.03 + 0.03 = 0.06, but the total was 0.05. That only shows up with discounts and only when the rounding happens to diverge, which fits the \"one in twenty\" report.\n\n**Fix:** `invoice_total` now sums `line_totals(inv)` and adds tax on that sum, so the charged total always equals the printed line sum. The public signatures are unchanged.\n\n**Regression test:** `test_discount_total_matches_printed_line_sum` in `tests/test_billing.py` checks the per-line amounts and that the invoice total equals their sum.\n\nTwo things to be aware of:\n- The change can shift totals by a cent for invoices where per-line rounding diverges from the old total. That is the intended correction, but it changes amounts that were previously charged, so billing may want to know before deploying.\n- Running pytest modified two tracked `__pycache__/*.pyc` files. I left them as they are; you may want to revert them or add `__pycache__` to `.gitignore`.\n\nI have not committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2033,"cache_read_input_tokens":54696,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2033},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e049d9bb-6b24-410d-9783-9ac2a65aa891","uuid":"c0e7fa42-1d2b-4416-8525-cf5125bb5c5a","timestamp":"2026-10-09T17:07:40.929Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs2iWCEoNEufggXvJKUr"}
